{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id42178862"}, "name":{"label":"CaptPJ"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-06-01T14:58:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.61.0"}, "id":{"label":"8731320898"}, "title":{"label":"A perfect app with a lot of thought and effort behind it"}, "content":{"label":"I found this via the Apple Design Awards Finalists announcement and thought I’d download to give it a try. This coincided with realising that I’d been drinking too much coffee, sports and soft drinks and needed to have a focus for drinking more water again. It’s a simple app with a lovely interface, some great interactions - challenges, characters, Apple Watch app, instructions for installing the widget, connecting with health and changing the app icon. It also has the option to buy a sub to support development in an ongoing way or pay a one-time amount to get the premium features so you don’t have to bear subs in mind. Both at incredibly reasonable amounts. \n\nI don’t know why there aren’t more apps doing this - both in terms of offering two payment options and also the reasonableness of the prices. I feel like app subs would be so elastic that dropping the price should attract, proportionally, many more users. Thanks team!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
